{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36463","headline":"春山山馆旅怀 · 罗邺","name":"春山山馆旅怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山馆吟余山月斜，东风摇曳拂窗花。\n岂知驱马无闲日，长在他人後到家。\n孤劒向谁开壮节，流年催我自堪嗟。\n灯前结束又前去，晓出石林啼乱鸦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}